# Doc Ock, Sinister Scientist: "As long as you control another Villain, Doc Ock has hexproof." (CR 702.11, 604.1.) T1 the five Moxen pay
# for him. T2 Bot2 casts an Aerial Doombot (a Villain on the OTHER side: it gives him nothing) and Bolts Doc Ock - allowed, as he is
# a Villain himself but not "another" one; he takes 3 and lives. T3 Bot1 casts its own Aerial Doombot: now Bolting him is refused.
# T4 Bot2 Bolts the Doombot instead (allowed: hexproof is his alone), it dies, and a second Bolt at Doc Ock is legal again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Doc Ock, Sinister Scientist
Aerial Doombot
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Aerial Doombot
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

