Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Doc Ock, Sinister Scientist)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Aerial Doombot)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Doc Ock, Sinister Scientist)
Bot1.Pass

